__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Result files you generate by running the benchmarks. Every run stamps its
# filename to the second, so a run of your own never lands on the name of a
# committed reference file: it is a new path, and this pattern keeps it out of
# git. A gitignore entry cannot protect a file that is already tracked, which
# is why the guarantee has to come from the filename rather than from here.
results/*.json
